></description><link>https://secondthoughts.ai/p/hyperproductivity?utm_source=%2Finbox&amp;utm_medium=reader2</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://secondthoughts.ai/p/hyperproductivity?utm_source=%2Finbox&amp;utm_medium=reader2</guid><pubDate>Sun, 23 Nov 2025 12:03:19 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Hyperproductivity: The Next Stage of AI?]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>Recently, I’ve been hearing of a new phenomenon: teams reportedly using agentic AI tools to “enter takeoff” – achieving astounding feats of productivity that escalate each week, with no limit in sight…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://secondthoughts.ai/p/hyperproductivity?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://secondthoughts.ai/p/hyperproductivity?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/ai-links-11232025">AI links, 11/23/2025</a></p>]]></description><link>https://secondthoughts.ai/p/hyperproductivity?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://secondthoughts.ai/p/hyperproductivity?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Sun, 23 Nov 2025 12:03:19 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[How to Use ChatGPT Without Brain-Rot]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>Is AI rotting your brain? Maybe. But it might depend on how you’re using it…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://davidepstein.substack.com/p/how-to-use-chatgpt-without-brain?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://davidepstein.substack.com/p/how-to-use-chatgpt-without-brain?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/ai-links-11232025">AI links, 11/23/2025</a></p>]]></description><link>https://davidepstein.substack.com/p/how-to-use-chatgpt-without-brain?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://davidepstein.substack.com/p/how-to-use-chatgpt-without-brain?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Sun, 23 Nov 2025 12:03:19 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Three Years from GPT-3 to Gemini 3]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>I’ve been testing Google’s new Gemini 3 model. It is very good. But rather than give you benchmark numbers, I’m going to show you how far AI has come in three years by asking the AI to demonstrate it…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://www.oneusefulthing.org/p/three-years-from-gpt-3-to-gemini?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://www.oneusefulthing.org/p/three-years-from-gpt-3-to-gemini?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/ai-links-11232025">AI links, 11/23/2025</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.oneusefulthing.org/p/three-years-from-gpt-3-to-gemini?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.oneusefulthing.org/p/three-years-from-gpt-3-to-gemini?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Sun, 23 Nov 2025 12:03:19 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Does AI Cheapen Talk? (Bo Cowgill Pt. 1)]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>In this episode, we brought on our friend Bo Cowgill, to dissect his forthcoming Management Science paper, Does AI Cheapen Talk? The core question is one economists have been circling since Spence drew a line on the blackboard: What happens when a technology makes costly signals cheap…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://empiricrafting.substack.com/p/does-ai-cheapen-talk-bo-cowgill-pt?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://empiricrafting.substack.com/p/does-ai-cheapen-talk-bo-cowgill-pt?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/ai-links-11232025">AI links, 11/23/2025</a></p>]]></description><link>https://empiricrafting.substack.com/p/does-ai-cheapen-talk-bo-cowgill-pt?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://empiricrafting.substack.com/p/does-ai-cheapen-talk-bo-cowgill-pt?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Sun, 23 Nov 2025 12:03:19 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>